{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A young wanderer is lost in the forests, and accidentally unleashes something evil. A group of strangers need to become friends and find their own path to salvation to lift the curse that has befallen the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/extras/Keyart_WideRatio_ohnetext__1_.jpg?t=1743071191\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once Upon A Tile has you explore ever-changing dungeons guarded by monsters, traps and magical challenges. Perhaps you need to navigate a trap-filled corridor to the end, or defeat a certain amount of monsters or collect enough treasures to make it through alive. The reasons will change, but the goal remains the same - build the dungeon as you explore it, and avoid traipsing over too many traps or monsters you can not defeat yet. This will require a little bit of luck and a whole lot of strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While you play as a hero, you do not move directly. Instead, you follow the shortest paths to the newly discovered dungeon rooms you are exploring. This makes for a very unique and challenging game, where every steps and tile you place counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once Upon A Tile features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- endless replayability with procedurally generated dungeon-decks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- unlockable and upgradable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- an engaging, fully voiced storyline depending on which character you choose to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- complex mechanics that require you to think carefully, but easy to learn gameplay</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's A Roguelite, Alright","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465730/3e4e3a58908eda6a8abb3f9aaeee354e358f0308.jpg"},{"name":"Unleash the Curse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465730/a5cd5d17a4f225b90baf18a97c43850ad714a9d9.jpg"},{"name":"Walking the Distance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465730/5892542b44a11cad1c32ca5841c5571f28d76cd8.jpg"},{"name":"Into The Horizon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465730/d773c998dcff2ea6b17d52d6019321c81abac1f9.jpg"},{"name":"The Path of Distant Glory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465730/c2c94dc5e4db3a2dfa793243b9c81260ccd56f32.jpg"},{"name":"The Path of Distant Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465730/9d0b2d496917f0b31d4b4046326d52134762ef71.jpg"},{"name":"The Path of Distant Wealth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465730/a570309bbffe96703debc726873d6c857db61c35.jpg"},{"name":"The Path of Growing Glory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465730/c96efc2fdc5ae39451824f47e2d7ae882606834d.jpg"},{"name":"The Path of Growing Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465730/5d5107b618fbab5271dc2b8a8a30abebf54a69b8.jpg"},{"name":"The Path of Growing Wealth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465730/c3cba0479e414126ec635ea541e149ae4decc48b.jpg"}],"total":38},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2465730?t=1743071191","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743071191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/f8609275b14dee23838ac17b70f5c4497dea93ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743071191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/f8609275b14dee23838ac17b70f5c4497dea93ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743071191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A young wanderer is lost in the forests, and accidentally unleashes something evil. A group of strangers need to become friends and find their own path to salvation to lift the curse that has befallen the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/extras/Keyart_WideRatio_ohnetext__1_.jpg?t=1743071191\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once Upon A Tile has you explore ever-changing dungeons guarded by monsters, traps and magical challenges. Perhaps you need to navigate a trap-filled corridor to the end, or defeat a certain amount of monsters or collect enough treasures to make it through alive. The reasons will change, but the goal remains the same - build the dungeon as you explore it, and avoid traipsing over too many traps or monsters you can not defeat yet. This will require a little bit of luck and a whole lot of strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While you play as a hero, you do not move directly. Instead, you follow the shortest paths to the newly discovered dungeon rooms you are exploring. This makes for a very unique and challenging game, where every steps and tile you place counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once Upon A Tile features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- endless replayability with procedurally generated dungeon-decks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- unlockable and upgradable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- an engaging, fully voiced storyline depending on which character you choose to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- complex mechanics that require you to think carefully, but easy to learn gameplay</p>","developers":["KnotHorn Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"descript